<Page title="About" description="Why teamtoolbox exists and how it's built.">
  <p>
    teamtoolbox is a small collection of free tools for R&amp;D teams: the things you need for
    retrospectives, health checks and other team rituals, without sign-ups and without handing your
    team's conversations to someone else.
  </p>
  <p>
    Each tool is its own small app on its own subdomain, and new ones are added over time. They're
    paid for by one small, unobtrusive ad per page.
  </p>

  <h2 id="source">Source code</h2>
  <p>
    teamtoolbox is open source under the AGPL-3.0 license, so anyone can check how it handles data.
    The repository link will be published here at launch.
  </p>

  <h2 id="suggest">Suggest a tool</h2>
  <p>
    Missing something your team needs? Ideas are very welcome. Once the repository is public, open an
    issue there to suggest a tool.
  </p>
</Page>
